<title>POLAND: BOURSE TO ASSIMILATE TONSIL SHARES.</title>
<headline>BOURSE TO ASSIMILATE TONSIL SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Stock Exhange on December 2 will assimilate 585,000 shares in speaker systems maker Tonsil SA with shares already trading on the bourse, Tonsil said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The shares represent an April rights issue of 375,000 shares and 210,000 shares issued to Japan's Tohoku Pioneer Electronics Corp.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
